	(text "Probe diode: blocks VDOCK-20V\n(20 V) from the MCU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 151.13 102.87 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "31d2a904-3c85-42a3-acd2-040270465d1c")
	)
	(text "Dock contact options\n- pogo pins C7471744 2.7mm stroke, 12.3mm,\n  4A, 50V AC RMS, $0.4048 @1K, ~0.1W loss\n- C20626123 0.8mm wire nickel-plated spring, ~0.6W loss,\n  $0.067 @1K, can rust once plating wears off, can catch hair\n  - smaller C5143830 0.6mm wire nickel-plated spring\n- TBD dimpled nickel-plated spring-loaded contact"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.738 96.266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45972103-bd46-4ee2-9e6b-52626d528142")
	)
	(text "Q1003 soft start: R1012/R1015 set Vgs = -10 V, C1017 (Miller) ramps VDOCK-20V ~30 V/ms\n(~0.5 A inrush into the robot input caps); turn-off ~3 ms.\nCurrent: I-SENSE = 1 V/A (50 mOhm x 20), 3.3 A full scale. Turn off when it drops to ~0\n(robot left) or on overcurrent (ADC analog watchdog). Route INA180 IN-/IN+ Kelvin to R1016."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d5d9de41-effc-4b17-9ffe-43c032416209")
	)
	(text "Current sense amp\nGain 20"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e96c1338-d65f-4501-aec5-1af4a58fe7f2")
	)
	(text "Robot detection (firmware): with Q1003 off, PROBE-DRV high drives ~13 uA into VDOCK-20V.\nR_robot = V(VDOCK-20V) / ((3.3 V - V(PROBE-SENSE)) / 100k - V(VDOCK-20V) / 1.1M); the diode drop cancels.\nv1 robot signature: ~130k (R175 + R194 || 1.1M sense divider) and ~30 uF (settles in ~2 s).\nEnergize only after a stable reading inside the window; check VIN-SENSE < 22 V first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9295850-5ae8-4f2d-a13c-0d50987d66ab")
	)
